.TH DEEPFORGE 6 "2026-11-09" "Deepforge"
.SH NAME
deepforge \- voxel engine and agentic research testbed
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B deepforge
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Deepforge provides persistent voxel worlds, larger coordinates and matching
client/server networking. The optional platform adds scripting, scheduling,
controller memory and authenticated external actor control.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-help
Show command-line options.
.TP
.B \-version
Show the engine version.
.TP
.BI \-world " directory"
Select a world directory.
.TP
.BI \-config " file"
Read an explicit configuration file.
.TP
.BI \-test-module " name"
Run one compiled correctness module and exit before world startup.
.SH COMPATIBILITY
The expanded coordinate envelope requires protocol-32001 peers. New mapblocks
use format 30. Preserve an offline backup before upgrading a saved world.
.SH DOCUMENTATION
https://github.com/jknight137/deepforge-engine
